      "body": {
        "en": "A fine-tuned InternVL2-1B vision-language-action model that drives a truck in Euro Truck Simulator 2 from screen pixels. I profiled each stage of the pipeline and reduced inference latency from 691 ms to 57 ms per frame on a single consumer GPU.",
        "zh": "以微調後的 InternVL2-1B 視覺-語言-動作模型，直接從螢幕畫面駕駛《歐洲卡車模擬 2》。我逐段分析推論流程，在單張消費級 GPU 上將每幀延遲從 691 ms 降到 57 ms。"
      },
